# bashy verified build declaration for the OpenClaw gateway (builds/README.md).
# Shell-sourceable KEY=VALUE only. builds/render.sh renders ../fork from this
# file + files/ + build.yml + builds/_shared, and ships it verbatim as the
# fork's bashy-build/PIN. Bump only after reviewing the upstream release diff
# (see builds/openclaw/README.md). ONLY official stable release tags are
# accepted (no main/dev branches, no pre-releases, no RCs).
TOOL=openclaw
FORK_REPO=qiangli/openclaw
UPSTREAM_REPO=https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw
UPSTREAM_SLUG=openclaw/openclaw
UPSTREAM_TAG=v2026.10.2
UPSTREAM_COMMIT=b8952d477f0c932d8ddc6da5c89cab5a169b6ff1
# Toolchain kind: pnpm/Node build steps are tool-specific (build.yml next to
# this file: frozen pnpm install for the audit gates, audit gates, pinned
# upstream Dockerfile build + /app extract, SBOM of the extracted tree,
# bundled-copy patch + tarball verify, image digest per leg).
# No separate audit job.
KIND=custom
# Node 24 (upstream Dockerfile node:24-bookworm), pnpm 12.5.1 (upstream
# packageManager); used by build.yml.
NODE_VERSION=24
PNPM_VERSION=12.5.1
COSIGN_VERSION=v3.1.3
# Linux-only matrix (free GitHub runners only): each leg builds the pinned
# upstream Dockerfile natively on its own arch and extracts its built /app
# tree, so each leg ships its own arch's runtime. Asset names are
# openclaw-gateway-<os>-<arch>-${GITHUB_REF_NAME}.tgz. macOS assets are
# DEFERRED explicitly until a valid build path exists: macOS runners have no
# Docker daemon for the faithful Dockerfile path, and the previous native
# pack path died on all four legs of fork build 16 (run 38343035125).
MATRIX="openclaw-gateway-linux-amd64=ubuntu-24.04 openclaw-gateway-linux-arm64=ubuntu-24.04-arm"
# Linux host packages: strace + iproute2 for the no-egress gate, curl for the
# pinned http-cache-semantics replacement tarball. Docker is preinstalled on
# the ubuntu runners and builds the pinned upstream Dockerfile.
APT_PACKAGES="strace iproute2 curl"
PRE_BUILD_GATES=""
# The Dockerfile-built /app tree this leg extracted (staged under
# installed/package so the tar keeps its package/ top dir); the no-egress
# gate starts the gateway from it.
EGRESS_TARGET=installed/package
RELEASE_EXTRA="PIN=openclaw-pin.txt audit-exceptions=audit-exceptions"
RELEASE_ASSETS="openclaw-gateway-linux-amd64-${GITHUB_REF_NAME:-TAG}.tgz openclaw-gateway-linux-arm64-${GITHUB_REF_NAME:-TAG}.tgz openclaw-gateway-linux-amd64-sbom.cyclonedx.json openclaw-gateway-linux-arm64-sbom.cyclonedx.json openclaw-gateway-linux-amd64-audit-full.json openclaw-gateway-linux-arm64-audit-full.json openclaw-gateway-linux-amd64-image.digest openclaw-gateway-linux-arm64-image.digest openclaw-pin.txt audit-exceptions"
RELEASE_EXECUTABLES=""
RELEASE_NOTE="No tracking; OTel points only at the local collector 127.0.0.1:31415. Each gateway tarball is the pinned upstream Dockerfile's built /app runtime tree (node_modules included) for its Linux arch: unpack and run with no registry access. macOS assets deferred until a valid build path exists."
RELEASE_GATES="pinned commit, frozen pnpm install for the audit gates, pnpm audit vs reviewed exceptions, pinned upstream Dockerfile build + /app extract, CycloneDX SBOM of the extracted tree, bundled http-cache-semantics patch + tarball verify, no-egress."
